[
  {
    "start": 0,
    "duration": 14,
    "text": "看新聞 開視野",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 14,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "歡迎收看今天11月27號的公視手語新聞",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 19,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "首先來關心",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 22,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "為期12天的日本東京聽證奧運正式落幕",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 27,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "典禮上的表演也融入了日本文化與手語元素",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 33,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "各國選手齊聚一堂",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 36,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "為這場國際賽事劃下溫暖的句點",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 40,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "而這次臺灣選手是一共獲得了",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 43,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "一金六銀六銅的成績",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 46,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "在八十一個參賽國當中排名第二十三名",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "日本東京都知事小池百合子致辭後",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 59,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "特別以手語向所有選手表達感謝",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 62,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "並從國際聽證體育總會主席亞當科紹",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 65,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "手中接下感謝狀",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 67,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "日本公主家子也親臨現場觀禮",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 70,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "臺灣有曾拿過聽澳田徑時",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 75,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "向全能金牌的安慶龍教練代表長旗",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 78,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "各國代表也由龍人或聽人學生引導入場",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 82,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "其中龍學生為了與外國選手交流",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 85,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "還特別學習國際手語",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 87,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "學國際手語之後",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 89,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "讓我能跟沙烏地阿拉伯的選手聊天",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 92,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "真的很開心",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 94,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "國際手語比較難記",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 96,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "但跟外國人接觸時會自然學起來",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 99,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "最後也都能記住",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 101,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "隨著聽澳會起緩緩降下",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 107,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "也象徵東京聽澳圓滿落幕",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 115,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "活動正式結束",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 118,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "閉幕表演的主題是美好的未來",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 124,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "由日本龍人與聽人舞者共同呈現",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 127,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "他們穿著象徵聽澳會起",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 129,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "紅 藍 綠 黃不同顏色的服飾",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 133,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "以日本手語搭配太古節奏",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 136,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "現場選手也紛紛跟著律動",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 138,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "營造濃厚的日本慶典氛圍",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 141,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "大家看到我們都會主動打招呼",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 143,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "還會比武安 加油的手語",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 145,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "很多人都這樣跟我互動",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 147,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "不過 也有外國龍人媒體工作者表示",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 151,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "這次採訪人遇到不少溝通上的困難",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 168,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "2025年東京聽澳的閉幕典禮已經劃下句點",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 174,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但下一屆要由哪個國家主辦",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 176,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "目前還沒有定案",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 180,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "仁德等國際運動總會開會討論後",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 183,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "才會正式公佈",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 186,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "以上是公視記者牛軒文",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 188,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "吳嘉寶在日本東京的採訪報導",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 193,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "而在東京聽澳的開幕跟閉幕式",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 197,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "還有園遊會的舞台上",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 200,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "都能看到一位15歲龍人舞者的身影",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 204,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "他叫Maho",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 206,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "而他與台灣其實有著深厚的連結喔",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 212,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "因為他的舞蹈啟蒙老師",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 215,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "就是台灣的龍人舞者林靜蘭",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 228,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "東京聽澳園遊會的舞台上",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 231,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "舞者隨著HIPHOP節奏熱力四射",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 234,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "其中帶著亮橘色棒球帽",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 236,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "身穿藍色服裝的日本龍人舞者Maho特別吸睛",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 240,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "他九歲就開始登台表演",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 242,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "而讓他踏上舞蹈之路的啟蒙者",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 245,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "正是來自台灣的龍人舞者林靜蘭",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 255,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "就在東京聽澳前一週的東京龍人藝術節",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 259,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "兩人在活動上再次重逢",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 261,
    "duration": 21,
    "text": "好像看到了自己的女兒一樣",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 282,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "我是媽媽 看著她一路長大",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 285,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "真的替她感到驕傲",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 288,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "原來月牙計畫能讓這麼多小小的種子發芽 茁壯",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 294,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "林靜蘭當年推動月牙計畫",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 298,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "希望讓龍人孩子也能接觸舞蹈",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 301,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "而Maho正是其中之一",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 303,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "如今她加入日本混帳舞團",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 306,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "轉攻HIPHOP 隨團在各地演出",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 309,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "更參與聽澳開幕典禮表演",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 312,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "看到來自世界各地的龍人觀眾",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 314,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "也讓她眼界大開",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 316,
    "duration": 14,
    "text": "對Maho而言 舞蹈不只是動作技巧",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 330,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "更是情感的延伸",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 339,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "舞台上Maho用身體講述情感",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 341,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "在舞台下",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 343,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "她和啟蒙者林靜蘭之間的傳承",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 346,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "也持續延伸",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 348,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "Maho說 未來會持續跳舞",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 351,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "希望有一天能像林靜蘭一樣",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 354,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "走向世界舞臺",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 356,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "讓更多人看見她的舞蹈",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 358,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "公視新聞由宣文吳嘉寶",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 360,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "日本東京採訪報導",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 362,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "東京舞蹈教室",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 366,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "採訪報導 東京停澳期間",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 370,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "不少外國選手和觀眾",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 373,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "利用空檔到東京街頭走走",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 377,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "而其中有一家名叫面巫藝的拉麵店",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 382,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "特別受到龍人族群的青睞",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 386,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "因為店長也是龍人",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 390,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "曾經是摔角選手的她",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 392,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "如何跨行開啟拉麵店的呢",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 395,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "帶您一起來瞭解",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 398,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "拉麵店門口最醒目的",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 402,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "就是那個大大的義字",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 404,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "一走進店裡",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 405,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "就能夠看到許多客人用手語聊天",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 408,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "牆上還貼著有聽到選手簽名的海報",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 412,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "跟美國人嘗試聊天",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 416,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "雖然手語有點不太一樣",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 419,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "但看表情配合手語就OK了",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 424,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "聽說這裡有一家龍人店長開的店",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 427,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "我就想說一定要來吃吃看",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 429,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "不只可以體驗日本文化",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 431,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "又是龍人的店",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 433,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "當然要支持",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 434,
    "duration": 11,
    "text": "店裡之所以聚集許多龍人",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 445,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "是因為店長毛總和一本身就是龍人",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 448,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "他原本是一名摔角選手",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 450,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "還成立自己的龍人摔角團隊",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 453,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但是收入不穩定",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 455,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "讓他萌生轉行開店的想法",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 458,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "有一次在電視看到拉麵學校的資訊",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 461,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "他立刻報名",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 462,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "但是卻遇到不小的挑戰",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 465,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "老師一邊煮麵一邊講話",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 467,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "我完全聽不懂",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 468,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "我還問說可不可以帶手語翻譯一起來",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 471,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "結果他說要付兩個人的學費",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 473,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "加起來要雙倍",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 475,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "我覺得太貴了",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 476,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "只好自己去上課 用筆彈解決",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 482,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "靠著觀察老師的動作",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 484,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "向同學借筆記反覆練習",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 487,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "毛總和一最終在畢業考試中",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 489,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "拿到六名學生裡的第一名",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 492,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "二零一六年",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 493,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "他開了屬於自己的拉麵店",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 495,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "也僱用龍人員工一起工作",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 498,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "這次適逢東京聽召奧運",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 500,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "他也明顯感受到客人變多了",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 512,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "從摔角擂臺走進廚房",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 520,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "毛總靠著拉麵圓了夢",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 522,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "他說無論是看見龍人或聽人客人",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 525,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "在吃完拉麵之後",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
