    "start": 1407,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "二十六號下午兩點五十一分",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1409,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "因大樓外牆的竹子鷹架失火通報火警",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1412,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "香港消防處在最初報案後的",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1414,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "四十分鐘內列為嚴重程度第四級",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1417,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "大約三個半小時",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1418,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "也就是六點二十二分左右",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1420,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "深至最高的五級火警",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1422,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "香港上一次出現五級火警",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1424,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "已經是十七年前的事",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1426,
    "duration": 17,
    "text": "當局表示整個大火場形成極度的高溫",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1443,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "而且燒得又快",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1444,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "消防員無法進入救人",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1446,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "建築物內還不斷傳出爆炸聲",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1448,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "消防水柱也難以噴灑到較高樓層",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1451,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "天色變暗之後救火任務更為艱巨",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1454,
    "duration": 11,
    "text": "火警發生時高樓住宅外",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1465,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "包覆著竹子鷹架正進行整修",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1467,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "當局已展開調查",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1469,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "保安局長鄧炳強表示",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1471,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "火事蔓延的速度異常的快",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1473,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "如果當時使用的是符合法規的",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1475,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "建材與棚架",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1476,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "火事不應該如此快速地吞噬整棟建築物",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1480,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "中國國家主席習近平對這場重大",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1482,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "火警死傷者表示哀悼",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1484,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "數百名居民已被疏散至臨時庇護中心",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1487,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "需要安置的住戶也正緊急安排臨時住所",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1490,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "竹子鷹架是香港特有的建築技術",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1493,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "在許多香港知名電影場景中都曾出現",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1496,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "竹子因為比較輕巧",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1497,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "從中國南方運輸比較方便",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1499,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "在香港狹小的都市環境中",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1501,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "更容易搬運跟施工",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1503,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "公視新聞 黃韻玲編譯",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1507,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "接著來關心天氣 東北季風南下水氣增多",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1511,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "今天北部 東半部 還有南部地區",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1515,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "中部山區降雨機率提高",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1518,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "尤其在桃園以北 東半部地區",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1521,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "以及恆春半島有局部短暫雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1525,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "外出建議攜帶雨具備用",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1529,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "接著提供您各地的氣象資料",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
